<title>UK: LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</title>
<headline>LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Reuter - Following are the buying and selling rates for leading world currencies and gold against the dollar on the London foreign exchange and bullion markets today.</p>
<p>US$1.00 COSTS    1.3955/60  Canadian Dollars</p>
<p>		     1.7250/60  German Marks</p>
<p>		     1.9413/18  Dutch Guilders</p>
<p>		     1.4370/80  Swiss Francs</p>
<p>		     35.57/62   Belgian Francs</p>
<p>		     5.8217/27  French Francs</p>
<p>		     1684.0/5.0 Italian Lire</p>
<p>		     113.74/84  Japanese Yen</p>
<p>		     7.6662/37  Swedish Crowns</p>
<p>		     7.2590/40  Norwegian Crowns</p>
<p>		     6.5687/97  Danish Crowns</p>
<p>One sterling     US$1.6648/58</p>
<p>Gold (ounce)     US$337.85/15</p>
</text>
